This product includes software developed for the paper "Weakly Supervised
Noisy Label Cleaning for Cough-Based TB Screening" (APSIPA ASC 2026).

The cough detector in cad/ follows the approach of Jansen van Vüren et al.,
"Cough activity detection for automatic tuberculosis screening",
arXiv:2603.11241, 2026. The code and model weights in cad/ are our own.

Datasets, Qwen3-Omni and HeAR model weights are not distributed with this
repository and remain under their own licences (see README.md).
